WEBVTT

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:17.280
The ships! Everyone on the ships! It's our only chance!

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:36.520
It's too late!

00:03:28.990 --> 00:03:29.530
What a power!

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.160
through the universe, a monstrous planet

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:34.940
that devours everything in its path.

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:38.440
Its goal is the small planet Cybertron,

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:41.660
on which the race of the Transformers

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:44.580
continues to fight in a fratricidal war,

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:47.150
a war between good and evil

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:49.620
that has lasted for millions of years.

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:55.150
These Decepticons, led by the demonic Megatron,

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:58.840
have sworn to crush their enemies, the Autobots.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:06.240
To achieve their goal, they chased them through the galaxy from Cybertron's planet to Earth.

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:14.310
But the heroic Autobots and their brave leader Optimus Prime are not easily defeated.

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:29.920
It's 2005. The Innocent Decepticons have invaded Cybertron, the Autobot planet.

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:40.060
But in secret bases hidden under the surface of the two moons of Cybertron,

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:43.120
the valiant Autobots are preparing to reconquer their homeland.

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:56.980
Clyde, I'm listening to your report.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:59.780
Every time I look at one of these ex-

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:06.250
I have my dirty circuits, but when will we finally give a lesson to these Decepticons?

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:10.220
I order you to go on a special mission on Earth.

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:11.930
But, Brian...

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:17.020
Listen to me, Aronide. We no longer have enough Tenergon reserves to launch a massive attack.

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:18.710
Get ready to launch the shuttle!

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:22.230
Good day without counting now, Decepticons.

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:32.880
Jazz, report from the observation centre.

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:35.160
No sign of life of the Decepticons.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:36.620
Nothing of the lunar base number 2?

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:38.440
Jazz calls lunar base number 2.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:40.440
Jazz calls lunar base number 2.

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:43.620
Bumblebee and Spike are listening.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.860
We will launch the space shuttle.

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:48.260
No Decepticons in your sector?

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:49.480
Nothing on the radar, Jazz.

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:52.360
Ironhide, tell my son Daniel that I miss him a lot.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:54.430
And tell him not to worry.

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:56.970
I will come back home as soon as we have pushed

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:58.870
the megatrons to the other side of the galaxy.

00:05:59.030 --> 00:05:59.670
See you soon.

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:02.940
Clipjumper, start the countdown.

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:09.130
Five, four, three, two, one, zero.

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:20.340
All we need now is a little Energon and a lot of luck.

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:31.680
Laserbeak is back, Megatron.

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:33.800
Welcome, Laserbeak.

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:37.360
You are the only one among all my soldiers who never fails me.

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:42.250
Célule, spy, send me the recordings of Laserbeak.

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:45.080
At your service, Megatron.

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:51.910
I order you to take a special mission on Earth.

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:58.410
Listen to me, Aronaid, we no longer have enough energy reserves to launch a massive attack.

00:06:58.690 --> 00:06:59.970
Same to you.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:05.810
Now we only need a little Energon and a lot of luck.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.630
Come on, Optimus Prime!

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:26.410
Megatron! The Decepticons!

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:28.850
Death to the Autobots!

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:32.270
You

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:08.000
It was really too easy, Starscream.

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:11.410
Much easier, very powerful Megatron,

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:16.170
than for the real objective, the moon base of the Autobots.

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:18.560
You are an imbecile, Starscream.

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:21.500
We will infiltrate their defense lines,

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.780
in one of their ships, and we will destroy the Autobot city,

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:26.440
so we will be rid of them forever.

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:28.690
No!

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:31.930
It's free heroism.

00:08:44.180 --> 00:08:45.700
There's a lot of fish this morning, Daniel.

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:46.910
Looks like it.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:48.740
What do you have?

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:50.270
I don't know.

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:54.560
Tell me what's wrong, Daniel.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:56.280
It's because I'm bored, Dad.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.720
Don't worry, Spike will be back soon.

00:08:59.040 --> 00:08:59.680
Hey, that's it!

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:07.350
I don't think it's that big.

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:18.780
You're talking about a show.

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:29.910
I hear you.

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:42.900
You want to go fast, learn how to drive first.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.960
Don't let me go any further!

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:01.220
A little more to the left!

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:12.620
You bastard! I'm going to teach you a lesson!

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:13.590
What?

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:32.530
The Decepticons!

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:40.230
What has this young fool invented?

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:40.670
Honey!

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:32.320
Hey, not so bad for an old debris!

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:36.860
Old debris? You'll never become an old debris if you stay here!

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:38.180
Watch out, Cain!

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:07.400
Ultramanius, a quick assessment of the attack capacity of the Decepticons

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:09.040
indicates a certain tactical deficiency.

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:11.680
In other words, Perceptor, we are lost.

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:20.970
Springer, Arcee, get ready to transform the city.

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:23.320
Perceptor, ask Prime for reinforcements.

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:24.160
Make it quick.

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:27.020
Maggette, tell me, what can I do to help?

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:29.240
Blur, you take care of giving the alert.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.840
Perfect! No one can work as fast as me, I swear!

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:34.160
Come on, Arcil, we have to hurry!

00:12:35.510 --> 00:12:37.210
But wait, the cabs are outside!

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.530
We can't wait any longer! Let's go!

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:55.280
It's delicious, isn't it, Miss Charlemagne?

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:07.250
The Insecticans are blocking the entrance!

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:09.080
Yes, but it's the only way!

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.230
Come on, let's get out of here!

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:27.120
Fire at will!

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:35.510
Hey, Perceptor! They're taking the fortress for a yoyo! Blaster!

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:39.720
Ultramanus has given the order to warn Prime on the lunar base number one!

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:42.610
All right! Cut the receivers, Perceptor!

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:55.290
Watch out, Mr. C!

00:14:58.490 --> 00:14:58.890
Handwave!

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:06.340
Humble Frenzy, ravage, rat, bat, ejection, operation, interference.

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:13.110
Simus Prime, do you copy?

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:17.280
The Decepticons are crushing the city. We are...

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:21.580
We will first crush your carcass.

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:23.880
Then we will crush your transistors.

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:34.150
Hey, Blaster, save yourself, quick!

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:35.600
No, no question.

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:37.440
One or two is much funnier.

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:39.250
I caught him.

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:54.340
Do you think Prime has received our message?

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:55.330
Let's hope so.

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:58.670
Because without reinforcements, we won't have time to look like crickets.

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:07.650
We're not here to laugh. You'll see what you'll see, who you'll attack, you'll see the Decepticons!

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:26.640
Hurry up, Arcy. We have to get this launcher back in place.

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:29.550
Megacron is overpowering us. We have to push him back.

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:34.740
Hold on! We'll give you a punch!

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.720
All together!

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:47.490
I thought you were stuck outside!

00:16:48.030 --> 00:16:50.690
I wasn't worried a single second!

00:16:51.390 --> 00:16:54.580
Then you didn't understand what's happening to us!

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:59.160
That's it!

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:06.750
Construct Titan, go to the final assault!

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:12.840
I'll devastate you!

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:19.100
I will reduce you to a pile of iron!

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:29.980
I have a lot better to do than die at the...

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:09.890
Their defenses are deep, massacre them all!

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:19.840
Inovo, destroy Devastator!

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:24.220
I, Grimlock, and my difficulties, Dinosaur!

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:31.980
COROSFORMATION!

00:18:33.070 --> 00:18:59.420
We must be pushed back, no matter the cost.

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:05.030
I'm in charge.

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:51.130
The best of us wins.

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:54.320
Why do you want to sacrifice yourself at all costs?

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:57.620
It's a question you'd better ask yourself, Megatron.

00:19:58.720 --> 00:19:59.040
Really?

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.300
Come on, I'm going to cut you into pieces!

00:20:04.540 --> 00:20:06.330
I have to help Prime.

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:08.760
Don't worry, kid, it's his fight.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:48.590
I'll tear off your optics!

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:58.640
Who's going to finish Prime?

00:20:58.940 --> 00:20:59.440
No mercy!

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:15.430
I beg you, Optimus Prime, let me live. I'm going to die without condition.

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:18.930
You, who have never had pity for anyone, you have a plan of mine.

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:21.600
I thought you were from another realm.

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:24.280
Don't move, Megatron!

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:26.330
Don't stay there, Othrand!

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:32.640
Die, die!

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:46.540
I've been waiting for this moment for an eternity.

00:21:47.020 --> 00:21:49.290
It's over for you, Prime.

00:21:51.500 --> 00:21:51.720
Go!

00:22:07.230 --> 00:22:08.980
Optimus, forgive me.

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:16.300
How do you feel, you cursed Megatron, eh?

00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:22.490
Artyom, let's get out of here!

00:22:23.360 --> 00:22:26.020
No, don't leave me, Soundwave.

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:28.460
At your service, Megatron.

00:22:47.520 --> 00:22:50.150
We're saved, thanks to Prime!

00:22:50.410 --> 00:22:59.780
Collage immédiat!

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:28.550
that these wounds are fatal.

00:23:40.680 --> 00:23:42.560
Don't be sad, little one.

00:23:43.460 --> 00:23:54.450
I'll soon make one more with the rice, Magnus.

00:23:54.490 --> 00:23:57.280
It's yours, old friend.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:04.140
I entrust you to take charge of the Matrix, as it was once entrusted to me.

00:24:06.200 --> 00:24:10.440
I am but a simple soldier. I am not worthy of it.

00:24:10.560 --> 00:24:12.940
I was no more worthy than you.

00:24:13.490 --> 00:24:17.840
But it is said that one day an Autobot will come out of our ranks

00:24:17.840 --> 00:24:26.580
and will use the powers of the Matrix to illuminate our darkest hours.

00:24:41.070 --> 00:24:45.010
Until the day comes when all will be united.

00:26:07.480 --> 00:26:10.280
We have to get out of here, or we'll never make it, Cybertron.

00:26:11.110 --> 00:26:13.050
Dear Decepticons,

00:26:13.400 --> 00:26:17.400
Astro Train has asked us to lighten our ship.

00:26:17.960 --> 00:26:20.810
In this case, only the strongest must survive.

00:26:21.980 --> 00:26:23.820
Does everyone agree?

00:26:24.580 --> 00:26:24.800
Yes!

00:26:25.280 --> 00:26:27.540
Who's against it?

00:26:27.920 --> 00:26:28.480
No one!

00:26:33.000 --> 00:26:44.760
It really makes me want to do that.

00:26:45.430 --> 00:26:47.210
Wait, I'm still working.

00:26:48.700 --> 00:26:49.960
Well, find it.

00:26:50.320 --> 00:26:51.760
Star Scriiiiip!

00:26:56.800 --> 00:26:59.500
Well, just like Megatron is.

00:27:00.190 --> 00:27:02.710
How can I say? He left us.

00:27:02.910 --> 00:27:06.590
I call myself your leader!

00:27:06.830 --> 00:27:12.190
We, the Constructitors, we make the devastating, invincible robot, we reign!

00:27:13.630 --> 00:27:16.870
Sunweb, superior. Constructitor, inferior.

00:27:17.400 --> 00:27:18.880
Who would you call inferior?

00:27:19.510 --> 00:27:22.330
No one will obey a coffee reader!

00:27:22.850 --> 00:27:26.030
Hey, no one has ever insulted Sunweb so impudently!

00:27:28.390 --> 00:27:29.610
Constructitor, unite!

00:27:32.840 --> 00:27:33.500
No, no way!

00:28:05.630 --> 00:28:07.610
Welcome Megatron...

00:28:22.960 --> 00:28:24.020
...Snicron!

00:28:30.120 --> 00:28:30.980
What are you waiting for?

00:28:30.980 --> 00:28:34.750
I summoned you here for a specific purpose.

00:28:35.450 --> 00:28:39.110
No one has ever been able to summon Megatron.

00:28:39.310 --> 00:28:42.420
In this case, I am delighted to be the first.

00:28:42.840 --> 00:28:44.070
What are you waiting for?

00:28:44.550 --> 00:28:47.460
Here are my orders.

00:28:47.940 --> 00:28:52.000
I want you to destroy the Matrix and its leader.

00:28:52.280 --> 00:28:59.390
It is the only and only thing that can still clear my way.

00:29:00.280 --> 00:29:06.420
You have nothing to fear anymore, I destroyed Optimus Prime with my own hands!

00:29:06.760 --> 00:29:08.520
You overestimate yourself.

00:29:08.680 --> 00:29:12.300
I know he's dead, and the Matrix is dead too.

00:29:13.070 --> 00:29:23.070
And I know that you're an idiot, and that the Matrix has been entrusted to their new leader, Ultra Magnus.

00:29:23.290 --> 00:29:25.480
I want you to destroy him.

00:29:26.220 --> 00:29:27.700
What does that have to do with me?

00:29:28.090 --> 00:29:29.770
I don't think your situation...

00:29:30.690 --> 00:29:37.710
I will give you a new body and provide you with new troops.

00:29:37.850 --> 00:29:38.170
And?

00:29:38.600 --> 00:29:39.930
And nothing else.

00:29:41.600 --> 00:29:43.540
Now you belong to me.

00:29:43.660 --> 00:29:46.000
I don't belong to anyone!

00:29:46.590 --> 00:29:49.290
Maybe I misjudged you.

00:29:50.400 --> 00:29:53.670
Keep your hand towards your navel.

00:29:54.380 --> 00:29:56.200
No! No! No!

00:29:56.870 --> 00:29:58.850
I accept all conditions!

00:29:59.310 --> 00:29:59.970
I accept all conditions!

00:30:05.660 --> 00:30:28.400
That's what's better for your body than to be cheated on.

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:32.200
Here are those who will help you in your mission.

00:30:32.460 --> 00:30:51.870
Only North and North Armada.

00:30:52.130 --> 00:30:54.900
Here is your new ship.

00:30:55.220 --> 00:30:57.400
And now, go!

00:31:00.220 --> 00:31:01.580
I will destroy the Matrix!

00:31:01.780 --> 00:31:07.470
I will put Ultra Magnus and all the Autobots in pieces

00:31:07.470 --> 00:31:10.050
as long as the Matrix hasn't been destroyed!

00:31:10.410 --> 00:31:15.620
On Cybertron!

00:31:40.810 --> 00:31:41.990
Let's end this ceremony.

00:31:42.270 --> 00:31:58.720
Dear Neceptican, as your new leader,

00:32:04.090 --> 00:32:04.970
Atheron, my crown!

00:32:05.450 --> 00:32:09.700
Your crown, Starscream!

00:32:10.040 --> 00:32:11.380
What a pleasure!

00:32:11.900 --> 00:32:13.840
You? Megatron?

00:32:14.280 --> 00:32:15.480
Yes, but stronger than before.

00:32:41.100 --> 00:32:43.980
Is there anyone else among you who wants a lesson?

00:32:44.770 --> 00:32:46.490
Yes, and what is his name?

00:32:48.280 --> 00:32:48.820
Galvatron!

00:32:49.020 --> 00:32:49.360
No!

00:33:01.980 --> 00:33:04.820
Where is it coming from?

00:33:08.070 --> 00:33:10.590
We don't care where it's coming from, we just need to know where it's going!

00:33:15.540 --> 00:33:17.320
Answer me! We're under attack!

00:33:27.540 --> 00:33:29.750
I'll call the police!

00:33:31.500 --> 00:33:35.900
Jazz, a gigantic and strange planet, has appeared in the space of Cybertron.

00:33:36.260 --> 00:33:38.960
She is attacking base number one!

00:33:39.720 --> 00:33:41.080
Jazz, Cliffjumper!

00:33:41.560 --> 00:33:52.310
Who's going to get out?

00:33:53.780 --> 00:33:53.940
Fire!

00:34:01.400 --> 00:34:03.130
Charles, a force is holding us back.

00:34:03.400 --> 00:34:10.870
Spike and Bumblebee, Spike and Bumblebee, we're on base two.

00:34:11.070 --> 00:34:14.730
This planet has completely destroyed the first fight.

00:34:14.810 --> 00:34:15.790
The first fight is destroyed.

00:34:16.110 --> 00:34:16.850
It's getting closer.

00:34:17.370 --> 00:34:18.870
We'll try to take care of it.

00:34:19.170 --> 00:34:21.580
But you have the interest to come very, very quickly.

00:34:25.650 --> 00:34:26.930
Bumblebee activates the explosives.

00:34:27.210 --> 00:34:29.970
And if it doesn't stop it, it's over.

00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:32.260
The explosives have been activated!

00:34:32.420 --> 00:34:33.480
Fire at full speed!

00:35:01.500 --> 00:35:02.820
Hooray! We did it!

00:35:03.180 --> 00:35:03.540
Yeah!

00:35:04.260 --> 00:35:07.910
She didn't move a micron.

00:35:18.190 --> 00:35:19.330
Cron, where are you going?

00:35:20.400 --> 00:35:23.120
Cybertron and his two moons belong to me!

00:35:30.030 --> 00:35:35.530
You, to whom we belong, I belong to no one!

00:35:35.850 --> 00:35:43.300
Good, I'm at your service.

00:35:49.040 --> 00:35:50.440
Decepticons, ground objective.

00:35:54.900 --> 00:35:56.630
Autobots, prepare the embarking.

00:35:56.870 --> 00:35:59.740
This new Decepticons' manoeuvre is the most...

00:36:00.570 --> 00:36:02.990
We must eliminate him by any means.

00:36:04.440 --> 00:36:05.680
What will become of Dad?

00:36:05.920 --> 00:36:09.590
He is a prisoner between this monstrous planet and Cybertron.

00:36:09.900 --> 00:36:12.960
Daniel, we will do the impossible to save Spike.

00:36:13.360 --> 00:36:14.720
But what are we going to do once there?

00:36:15.060 --> 00:36:18.080
If this thing devours the planets, I don't give a damn about our lives.

00:36:18.240 --> 00:36:19.980
Maybe the Matrix will help us.

00:36:20.260 --> 00:36:21.240
He is capable of it.

00:36:21.500 --> 00:36:22.700
What do you know about it, kid?

00:36:23.060 --> 00:36:24.020
I have the feeling.

00:36:24.500 --> 00:36:24.980
Look!

00:36:30.600 --> 00:36:30.780
Let's go!

00:36:31.180 --> 00:36:34.800
If Galvatron, I'll crush you!

00:36:35.170 --> 00:36:37.180
Just like Megatron crushed Prime!

00:36:37.560 --> 00:36:41.760
Just like Megatron, you'll have me!

00:36:42.700 --> 00:36:44.960
White Iron Autobot!

00:36:45.060 --> 00:36:48.040
Do you want me to read Ultra Magnus' account?

00:36:48.040 --> 00:36:52.160
There are so many other Autobots, let me personally take care of Ultra Magnus!

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:00.580
Not too much, either.

00:37:00.640 --> 00:37:06.880
You, do you believe in laser beams?

00:37:07.380 --> 00:37:09.120
Oh, my dear little Dino, my good little Dino,

00:37:09.140 --> 00:37:10.100
make an effort, move forward, move forward,

00:37:10.100 --> 00:37:11.380
we're entering this ship, come on, move forward,

00:37:11.400 --> 00:37:12.820
be a good little Dino, be a good little Dino,

00:37:12.820 --> 00:37:14.240
come into this beautiful ship, come on, come on!

00:37:14.440 --> 00:37:16.440
Don't talk nonsense, good little Dino,

00:37:16.440 --> 00:37:18.370
you must be careful!

00:37:35.280 --> 00:37:37.000
Fleur, bring the Dinobos into the shuttle.

00:37:37.280 --> 00:37:38.520
I know, I know, I know. I can't do it.

00:37:39.020 --> 00:37:40.340
They're not moving. They're moving.

00:37:40.500 --> 00:37:41.480
Look where you're going. It's impossible.

00:37:42.810 --> 00:37:43.510
Let them fall.

00:37:43.830 --> 00:37:44.830
Cut. Out of the way.

00:37:45.190 --> 00:37:46.810
Take care of the dinobots so we can finally leave.

00:37:47.070 --> 00:37:57.740
You little scum!

00:37:57.980 --> 00:37:59.420
You're going to get your ass back, aren't you?

00:38:06.650 --> 00:38:09.610
Reminds me of the battle on Alpha 9 when the Petrolapins were...

00:38:09.610 --> 00:38:11.790
Grimlock, get your big nose out of there, I can't see anything else.

00:38:12.030 --> 00:38:15.960
I, Grimlock, love memories of war, of cops.

00:38:16.300 --> 00:38:17.980
You're in the middle of it, my big guy.

00:38:18.000 --> 00:38:20.500
Start the flyers, in the name of Cybertron.

00:38:20.720 --> 00:38:24.680
I, Grimlock, want more Petrolapin stories.

00:38:24.700 --> 00:38:27.540
I'll give you Petrolapin. Contact.

00:38:39.500 --> 00:38:39.860
It's the same trouble!

00:38:40.580 --> 00:38:41.300
It's great!

00:38:41.900 --> 00:38:45.220
But if you have the evil of space, it would be better to go back to the base.

00:38:46.560 --> 00:38:52.220
Turn on!

00:39:02.910 --> 00:39:18.720
It was fair.

00:39:20.040 --> 00:39:22.220
Believe me, it's nothing. Wait for worse.

00:39:37.580 --> 00:39:39.310
Well done! Take a rest.

00:39:42.520 --> 00:39:45.160
Beta-4 was wrapped in a big cloud of dust.

00:39:45.600 --> 00:39:49.220
So dense, so gray, that we had to take off our optics...

00:39:49.220 --> 00:39:52.180
I'm a gray bloc. I know everything about ice cleaners.

00:39:52.240 --> 00:39:54.260
I want to hear the rest of the story.

00:39:54.910 --> 00:39:57.490
Sonde wants to hear the rest of the story.

00:39:58.180 --> 00:39:59.380
All right, all right.

00:40:00.092 --> 00:40:06.092
The dust was very dense and then we heard a gigantic wave.

00:40:06.092 --> 00:40:08.292
And we saw this thing coming down from the mountain,

00:40:08.292 --> 00:40:12.092
spitting flames through its nostrils, a real monster.

00:40:12.316 --> 00:40:16.556
Hey, Keup, you've got nothing better to do than say the same thing over and over again.

00:40:16.700 --> 00:40:22.200
Find a solution to save our friends and save Cybertron.

00:40:22.200 --> 00:40:24.500
We want stories!

00:40:24.732 --> 00:40:28.732
What a story! Tell me what a story!

00:40:30.890 --> 00:40:32.550
Let's not negotiate, it's too late.

00:40:33.030 --> 00:40:44.580
They're coming at us.

00:40:44.900 --> 00:40:47.000
Yes, like the dromedaries of Dromedon.

00:40:47.100 --> 00:40:48.080
How are you going to take them?

00:40:48.320 --> 00:40:51.640
I'm trying to remember how we managed to fight them that day.

00:40:51.820 --> 00:40:53.900
Oh yes, we reversed polarities.

00:40:54.400 --> 00:40:57.450
They're coming back.

00:41:05.020 --> 00:41:05.720
We've got it.

00:41:06.200 --> 00:41:08.310
And for this one, do you have an idea?

00:41:08.570 --> 00:41:14.320
Venus, transformation!

00:41:15.000 --> 00:41:15.380
Let's go, attack!

00:41:34.920 --> 00:41:35.840
I'm losing control!

00:41:40.190 --> 00:41:40.810
We're going to crash!

00:41:41.330 --> 00:41:48.340
Kup and Othrod hit him.

00:41:48.540 --> 00:41:50.230
For now, we can't do anything.

00:41:54.460 --> 00:41:58.460
The Decepticons won't leave us alone until we're all dead.

00:41:59.280 --> 00:41:59.860
Then...

00:42:00.030 --> 00:42:01.250
We'll see what we'll see.

00:42:01.600 --> 00:42:03.280
Prepare for the emergency landing.

00:42:03.400 --> 00:42:04.440
But it's madness!

00:42:04.740 --> 00:42:05.680
It's the only solution.

00:42:34.860 --> 00:42:36.560
The Autobots will be annihilated!

00:42:37.000 --> 00:42:40.520
Excellent! And the Matrix with them!

00:42:42.780 --> 00:42:45.390
Oh, Unicron! Why?

00:42:45.810 --> 00:42:48.220
Take me to Unicron!

00:42:48.340 --> 00:42:49.700
Take me now!

00:43:04.540 --> 00:43:06.720
Was it necessary to blow up three-quarters of the ship?

00:43:07.660 --> 00:43:11.420
Insofar as they would have blown up four-quarters, I think it was the right choice.

00:43:11.640 --> 00:43:13.460
How are we going to get out of this?

00:43:14.520 --> 00:43:17.020
Perceptor, can you locate an area where we can repair?

00:43:17.720 --> 00:43:20.540
Gamma waves in this area of space do not facilitate navigation.

00:43:22.740 --> 00:43:25.230
You know, I think I'll make it.

00:43:25.710 --> 00:43:27.570
In this corner, there is only the planet Craddock.

00:43:27.690 --> 00:43:28.690
Go for this planet!

00:43:46.510 --> 00:43:46.670
Come on!

00:44:07.160 --> 00:44:07.700
I'm here!

00:45:04.920 --> 00:45:08.140
Get ready for me.

00:45:08.180 --> 00:45:12.210
Get ready for me.

00:45:12.330 --> 00:45:13.980
Of course, Captain.

00:45:14.270 --> 00:45:14.710
Right away.

00:45:40.040 --> 00:45:40.380
Hang in there!

00:46:02.810 --> 00:46:03.330
Are you all right?

00:46:03.470 --> 00:46:10.330
I have to put the autopilot back on.

00:46:10.710 --> 00:46:19.010
I have to fix it.

00:46:20.190 --> 00:46:20.950
Can I help you?

00:46:21.170 --> 00:46:23.000
It's too dangerous, my boy.

00:46:24.310 --> 00:46:26.470
Daniel, put on this insulating suit.

00:46:27.320 --> 00:46:28.620
It's the equipment of this dear Spike.

00:46:30.640 --> 00:46:31.680
He talked so much about me!

00:46:31.880 --> 00:46:32.840
Here, sit in there.

00:46:32.980 --> 00:46:39.440
And now try to walk.

00:46:39.740 --> 00:46:40.810
Come on, you should be able to do it.

00:46:41.070 --> 00:46:52.460
Think carefully about what you want to do before you start.

00:46:53.480 --> 00:46:54.380
Isn't it a good idea to try?

00:46:54.740 --> 00:46:55.060
Oh!

00:46:55.620 --> 00:46:59.980
You have to train yourself.

00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:01.240
It will come little by little.

00:47:01.360 --> 00:47:04.380
Well, the recreation is over. There is a lot of work waiting for us.

00:47:04.480 --> 00:47:18.510
In the depot of the universe.

00:47:25.190 --> 00:47:26.570
Women, the committee of stinking crickets.

00:47:26.730 --> 00:47:29.260
You can always ask a grandmother if she makes good coffee.

00:47:30.060 --> 00:47:31.500
We won't let you get away with it.

00:47:31.640 --> 00:47:34.880
As long as you stay, we'll make you smell like hell.

00:47:44.220 --> 00:47:44.640
I'm done.

00:47:45.020 --> 00:47:46.310
See if it works.

00:47:55.610 --> 00:47:57.550
Electrically positive diodes and all the circles of the universe

00:47:57.550 --> 00:47:58.090
are on fire.

00:47:58.430 --> 00:47:59.410
You forgot a coin.

00:48:00.090 --> 00:48:01.770
No, you're just a little rusty.

00:48:02.500 --> 00:48:04.920
Kid, you've done a remarkable job.

00:48:05.080 --> 00:48:06.800
Look, it's his breath!

00:48:07.130 --> 00:48:07.470
Really?

00:48:08.200 --> 00:48:11.640
Yes, you've even eliminated the little scratch of my retina.

00:48:11.860 --> 00:48:13.820
Let's go looking for the worthy robots.

00:48:13.980 --> 00:48:15.540
I won't regret this twisted planet.

00:48:32.970 --> 00:48:35.930
Don't move. I'll give them the universal salute.

00:48:36.090 --> 00:48:37.650
The universal salute? What's that?

00:48:38.800 --> 00:48:40.540
They'll come and eat me in the hand.

00:48:41.680 --> 00:48:44.320
Bow, whip, grana, whip, ninibong.

00:48:44.610 --> 00:48:47.030
Bow, whip, grana, whip, ninibong.

00:48:52.370 --> 00:48:54.370
Universal salute works at all times.

00:48:54.970 --> 00:48:57.230
Now, without making a single sudden gesture,

00:48:57.290 --> 00:48:58.950
let's give them a few bars of Energon.

00:49:02.650 --> 00:49:04.150
But you're going to lead us to ruin!

00:49:04.430 --> 00:49:06.610
Don't worry, they'll give it back to the centuple!

00:49:06.670 --> 00:49:11.690
Is that what you call giving it back to the centuple?

00:49:12.270 --> 00:49:13.070
There's no more!

00:49:13.630 --> 00:49:17.000
Yes, it's empty!

00:49:33.740 --> 00:49:38.560
It reminds me of the bath in the nitrate mines on Galgana F7.

00:49:38.780 --> 00:49:40.640
What can you have as a souvenir?

00:49:41.160 --> 00:49:43.960
It's the experience, kid. You should learn to appreciate it.

00:49:44.100 --> 00:49:45.200
Your experience didn't really help us.

00:49:45.660 --> 00:49:47.790
Hey, what's going on here?

00:49:48.400 --> 00:49:52.800
His Imperial Majesty is ready to speak for the final sentence.

00:49:53.000 --> 00:49:53.860
Yes, ready.

00:49:54.810 --> 00:49:56.990
Is he guilty or innocent?

00:49:58.860 --> 00:49:59.420
Innocent.

00:50:00.830 --> 00:50:01.730
Welcome to Squaltican!

00:50:09.790 --> 00:50:13.700
Not too bad for a holiday club.

00:50:13.940 --> 00:50:22.740
But where?

00:50:25.010 --> 00:50:29.910
In the wild world of Squaltican and their cruel master, the Quintessence.

00:50:31.340 --> 00:50:35.400
I am Kranix. My planet was destroyed by Unicron.

00:50:36.220 --> 00:50:37.870
Unicron? But who is he?

00:50:38.640 --> 00:50:41.960
A planet. It devours everything on its way.

00:50:42.520 --> 00:50:44.610
So that's the name of this monster?

00:50:49.340 --> 00:50:52.190
Save me! I am the last survivor of my planet!

00:50:52.370 --> 00:50:55.070
No! Ah! No! No!

00:50:56.600 --> 00:50:57.080
Leave him!

00:51:00.510 --> 00:51:02.890
The next judgment will be yours.

00:51:03.450 --> 00:51:08.580
Is her imperial majesty ready to pronounce the final sentence?

00:51:09.220 --> 00:51:09.840
Ready.

00:51:10.280 --> 00:51:12.850
Is he guilty or innocent?

00:51:13.700 --> 00:51:16.080
Save me this parody of justice!

00:51:16.660 --> 00:51:21.030
I repeat, guilty or innocent?

00:51:23.100 --> 00:51:23.900
Innocent.

00:51:30.190 --> 00:51:38.670
I dreamed of a better end.

00:51:38.830 --> 00:51:51.410
I don't think there's anything at all.

00:51:51.750 --> 00:51:55.730
I, Grimlock, think that there's too much to talk about.

00:51:56.200 --> 00:51:59.880
That is to say that your polluting electrodes are oxidizing in the beryllium.

00:52:02.750 --> 00:52:06.400
You Grimlock, say that it's the stropolite in your wrinkled chest,

00:52:06.400 --> 00:52:08.560
you're just an oxydate of the beryllium.

00:52:09.300 --> 00:52:09.800
AAAAAAAAH!

00:52:10.670 --> 00:52:11.170
AAAAAAAAH!

00:52:12.010 --> 00:52:12.490
Who spoke?

00:52:25.580 --> 00:52:26.080
Grimlockist?

00:52:26.940 --> 00:52:29.930
If you know where you're going, then you're not...

00:52:31.530 --> 00:52:33.930
You, Grimlock, don't like it!

00:52:34.110 --> 00:52:45.780
How mean you are for hitting my nose!

00:52:45.940 --> 00:52:52.020
You, Grimlock, insist, it's the right track!

00:53:06.010 --> 00:53:09.160
Unicron, why did you torture me?

00:53:09.870 --> 00:53:11.110
You've fooled me.

00:53:11.630 --> 00:53:17.620
No, Unicron, Ultra Magnus is dead, and the Matrix is gone.

00:53:18.300 --> 00:53:24.730
The Matrix has not been destroyed, and Ultra Magnus is still alive.

00:53:25.050 --> 00:53:27.990
He's on Craddock, the Poultry Planet.

00:53:28.210 --> 00:53:29.450
Get him!

00:53:30.250 --> 00:53:35.130
Put it in pieces, Peter Matrix!

00:53:35.830 --> 00:53:42.970
Make sure everything is perfectly welded.

00:53:43.820 --> 00:53:46.120
Absolutely, absolutely, it will be perfect, it will be perfect, as always, absolutely perfect!

00:53:46.960 --> 00:53:49.020
Wow, Papa's armor is really great!

00:53:49.300 --> 00:53:50.880
You're starting to master it well!

00:53:54.740 --> 00:53:57.010
Oh, shit! We're going to have fun in the fight!

00:54:02.590 --> 00:54:05.710
The Decepticons. We have to repel them and protect the ship.

00:54:20.360 --> 00:54:20.720
Formation!

00:54:30.030 --> 00:54:30.430
Transformation!

00:54:30.470 --> 00:54:42.770
A human microbe!

00:54:43.640 --> 00:54:44.240
Transformation!

00:54:44.560 --> 00:54:54.800
Here they are! Attack them!

00:55:03.160 --> 00:55:05.740
I'm going to get you out of here! I'm going to try to free the Force from the Matrix!

00:55:06.020 --> 00:55:13.730
We're all for one!

00:55:13.890 --> 00:55:26.040
Help us, I beg you! Help us!

00:55:29.360 --> 00:55:29.900
Didn't you have...

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:32.140
He said that the Matrix would enlighten us in the darkness.

00:55:33.160 --> 00:55:35.990
Magnus, I want the Matrix.

00:55:36.530 --> 00:55:37.330
That, never.

00:55:37.930 --> 00:55:39.690
Zwips, exterminate him.

00:55:40.010 --> 00:55:54.760
My master.

00:55:56.390 --> 00:55:59.210
No, with that I will make you my slave.

00:56:04.350 --> 00:56:07.350
Before His Majesty pronounces the sentence,

00:56:07.690 --> 00:56:09.510
do you wish to ask for his forgiveness?

00:56:09.750 --> 00:56:12.950
Sometimes it works, but it's extremely rare.

00:56:13.230 --> 00:56:16.120
I can't change myself.

00:56:16.630 --> 00:56:17.370
Try again.

00:56:18.010 --> 00:56:20.550
Silence, or I'll condemn you for treason.

00:56:21.030 --> 00:56:23.670
Only contempt for this lowly court.

00:56:24.070 --> 00:56:26.630
Are they guilty or innocent?

00:56:27.550 --> 00:56:28.230
Innocent.

00:56:34.760 --> 00:56:37.160
There's more Squaltican than we have of Accu-Photos.

00:56:37.260 --> 00:56:40.320
Don't worry kid, we're going to make sardines out of them.

00:57:30.380 --> 00:57:31.740
I haven't even had a single scratch.

00:57:32.380 --> 00:57:35.650
Yes, but look, he can smell it everywhere, from his sardines.

00:57:37.480 --> 00:57:42.760
We'll never get rid of them.

00:57:43.020 --> 00:57:45.460
In the meantime, it's going to cost them dearly in the body shop.

00:57:45.600 --> 00:57:46.320
You can believe that.

00:58:13.690 --> 00:58:14.390
Crush it!

00:58:14.410 --> 00:58:20.790
You, Grimlock, would eat fries well!

00:58:44.970 --> 00:58:48.010
I would never have thought I'd be so happy to see these big assholes.

00:58:48.510 --> 00:58:51.290
Me Grimlock, not assholes, me being king.

00:58:52.710 --> 00:58:54.150
Qualitican, execute them.

00:59:02.620 --> 00:59:03.460
Execute him!

00:59:03.840 --> 00:59:11.760
It seems to me that the problem of this planet will be solved very quickly.

00:59:12.990 --> 00:59:15.570
Yes, but our problem is not solved, we do not have a ship.

00:59:15.770 --> 00:59:18.750
Who are you?

00:59:19.090 --> 00:59:19.450
Him!

00:59:19.940 --> 00:59:20.760
Winnie the Pooh!

00:59:22.710 --> 00:59:24.890
Well, he will be mine too if he finds us a shuttle.

00:59:25.290 --> 00:59:26.630
And there, you do not see?

00:59:28.080 --> 00:59:29.020
What? That? A ship?

00:59:30.120 --> 00:59:31.960
After all, what does it matter if he can take us?

00:59:32.200 --> 00:59:46.540
In the Matrix, there is no more hope, no more hope, no more hope, no more hope!

00:59:48.060 --> 00:59:50.580
First, Praia, but now Ultra Magnus, but what are we going to become?

00:59:53.920 --> 00:59:55.160
Don't let him go, buddy!

00:59:55.700 --> 00:59:58.840
Put your eyes in the closet and let us break a rock'n'roll of hell!

01:00:00.030 --> 01:00:02.750
And so on and on and on and on and on...

01:00:41.770 --> 01:00:51.020
I don't know what it is, and it doesn't happen easily, what is it?

01:01:47.720 --> 01:01:51.940
We have visitors. If you think this is where you'll find oil, you're wrong.

01:02:01.400 --> 01:02:06.160
Drop your weapon, we're going to try to parliament.

01:02:06.580 --> 01:02:08.700
And they, they drop their weapons?

01:02:09.390 --> 01:02:11.250
How is it already the universal salute?

01:02:11.510 --> 01:02:12.410
Oh yes, yes, I remember.

01:02:59.850 --> 01:02:59.970
Thanks for watching!

01:03:00.780 --> 01:03:03.700
Because a little click is better than a big slap.

01:03:04.280 --> 01:03:06.480
Where did you learn to speak this language?

01:03:06.840 --> 01:03:10.630
On TV. We talk on TV. Do you know how to talk on TV?

01:03:10.830 --> 01:03:12.030
It happens to me sometimes.

01:03:12.390 --> 01:03:13.570
And now here's the news.

01:03:13.770 --> 01:03:14.790
See you at noon. Good evening.

01:03:15.670 --> 01:03:21.590
It's the month of the white iron, it's the last novelty with 90 days of guarantee.

01:03:31.600 --> 01:03:32.440
And here he is, repaired!

01:03:33.000 --> 01:03:33.660
Good morning!

01:03:34.100 --> 01:03:43.970
You all came out of it?

01:03:44.820 --> 01:03:45.620
The Matrix!

01:03:46.080 --> 01:03:48.360
He disappeared.

01:03:50.360 --> 01:03:51.760
And with him, all hope?

01:03:52.160 --> 01:03:52.400
No!

01:03:53.300 --> 01:03:54.100
It's Galvatron!

01:03:54.300 --> 01:03:55.900
Where is Galvatron? Where is he?

01:03:56.200 --> 01:03:59.850
The answer is on Unicron!

01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:02.450
Well, we have to destroy Unicron!

01:04:02.940 --> 01:04:06.360
Yes, we have to destroy Unicron! Kill this horror!

01:04:07.390 --> 01:04:09.990
Eliminate the most recalcitrant of its tasks!

01:04:10.070 --> 01:04:13.810
Pouce, s'amousse, depechons, depechons, this promotion is over!

01:04:14.230 --> 01:04:16.430
You can test everything without the obligation of purchase.

01:05:00.090 --> 01:05:02.910
Now tell me what you fear the most!

01:05:03.270 --> 01:05:09.540
Go obey me or suffer my wrath!

01:05:10.040 --> 01:05:18.190
I underestimate Galvatron!

01:06:07.580 --> 01:06:11.300
I had thought of saving your kind of little planet,

01:06:11.560 --> 01:06:12.960
the damn Galvatron.

01:06:13.100 --> 01:06:17.050
But now you will witness its annihilation.

01:06:17.690 --> 01:06:18.590
No!

01:06:28.020 --> 01:06:29.960
Septicane, we're under attack!

01:07:10.750 --> 01:07:13.090
That doesn't remind you of anything, Cup?

01:07:13.390 --> 01:07:16.640
No, I've never seen anything like it.

01:07:16.920 --> 01:07:18.680
What happened to Base 2?

01:07:18.860 --> 01:07:22.660
We'll try to find it.

01:07:30.480 --> 01:07:30.800
Special

01:07:30.800 --> 01:07:33.420
resistant to fire, water and corrosion.

01:07:33.740 --> 01:07:35.270
You will be satisfied.

01:07:36.110 --> 01:07:36.750
Rewarded.

01:07:38.100 --> 01:07:38.740
Rewarded.

01:08:06.200 --> 01:08:08.560
I don't know, but I hope he didn't get it.

01:08:51.500 --> 01:08:54.340
We will be of no use to Tobo. We cannot free his force.

01:08:54.670 --> 01:08:56.570
No Decepticon can open it.

01:08:57.120 --> 01:08:59.760
Now, we are allies against...

01:09:00.000 --> 01:09:00.900
This common enemy.

01:09:02.540 --> 01:09:08.080
Destroy it now, Galvatron, or you will be put in pieces.

01:09:08.760 --> 01:09:11.010
I obey, master!

01:09:26.880 --> 01:09:29.320
Inable Autobot, you have no-

01:09:30.090 --> 01:09:31.010
How dare you, you bastard!

01:09:31.930 --> 01:09:48.750
I'll blow you up!

01:10:05.850 --> 01:10:08.800
I, Grimur, need a new strategy!

01:11:20.410 --> 01:11:20.790
Daniel! Daniel!

01:11:21.280 --> 01:11:23.820
Drop the blanket!

01:11:25.960 --> 01:11:26.880
Make him jump, son!

01:11:27.260 --> 01:11:27.850
I don't...

01:11:28.900 --> 01:11:29.740
Get out of your suit!

01:11:30.000 --> 01:11:50.860
Come on, you did it!

01:11:51.100 --> 01:11:52.800
Yes, I did it!

01:11:53.100 --> 01:11:58.180
Get out of here, Autobot!

01:12:00.060 --> 01:12:01.040
We will all die one day.

01:12:01.080 --> 01:12:03.190
Not today, anyway.

01:12:42.800 --> 01:12:49.710
And with my own hands, this is the end of you, Otobo!

01:13:08.540 --> 01:13:12.540
Then Ultra Magnus, and now it's your turn.

01:13:13.308 --> 01:13:16.808
What a shame that autoboomers die so easily.

01:13:16.808 --> 01:13:20.808
It hides the pleasure and satisfaction of winning.

01:13:23.164 --> 01:13:24.164
You got the d-

01:13:27.580 --> 01:13:29.980
Get up, Optimus Prime!

01:13:30.920 --> 01:13:31.600
Help me!

01:13:34.380 --> 01:13:34.600
No!

01:13:35.060 --> 01:13:46.220
The arrival at the end of your journey,

01:13:46.620 --> 01:13:47.420
Calphatron!

01:14:08.000 --> 01:14:11.080
Now, light up our darkest hour.

01:14:54.988 --> 01:14:55.988
I understand.

01:14:56.076 --> 01:14:57.436
Springer, what's going on?

01:14:57.644 --> 01:14:59.964
No need to try to understand. Let's get out of here.

01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:14.080
Autobots, start transforming and get out of here!

01:15:14.430 --> 01:15:21.960
I knew you had guts, kid!

01:16:07.230 --> 01:16:10.530
Let's mark the end of the cybertronic war.

01:16:11.090 --> 01:16:14.350
Let's march towards an era of peace and joy

01:16:14.350 --> 01:16:16.620
until we make one.

01:16:16.780 --> 01:16:18.720
Until we make one!

01:16:18.960 --> 01:16:21.350
Until we make one!

01:16:21.690 --> 01:16:27.920
The battle is over, but the galaxy awaits

01:16:27.920 --> 01:16:29.880
and the adventures of the Transformers

01:16:30.000 --> 01:16:31.000
We'll keep going.

01:16:31.148 --> 01:16:35.148
and the greatest of the Autobots, Optimus Prime, will return to us.
